WEBVTT

00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:09.804
AI Agents puts AI to work on your tickets and docs, with people still in charge. In this video, you’ll see your agents, how they run, and what they did.

00:00:10.829 --> 00:00:21.282
Open Agents. Worklynq agents look things up and, when you allow it, create and update tickets and docs. Each one works as the person who runs it, never with more access.

00:00:22.299 --> 00:00:29.254
Run one yourself, on a schedule, or when a ticket reaches a stage, and choose whether it asks before making changes.

00:00:30.278 --> 00:00:41.691
Connected agents lists your team’s own Claude, ChatGPT, or Cursor connected to Worklynq. Coding agents hand a ticket to Claude or Cursor, and get a pull request back.

00:00:42.738 --> 00:00:48.626
And Activity logs everything any agent did: what it read, what it changed, and who it acted for.
